* AQUILA functional equivalent, NOT the Analog Devices AD3541R macromodel.
* ADI lists an official LTspice model; it could not be retrieved here.
* 0..2.5 V span, 16-bit rounding, explicit 1-pole settling, 0.5-ohm Rout.
* 100 ns to 0.1% => tau=14.476 ns. This is an approximation, not a fit.
* No SPI, reference drift/noise, INL/DNL, glitch impulse or DAC supply current.
* Power pins are explicit for schematic review, NOT functional power modeling.
* Pin order: CMD OUT AGND AVDD DVDD VLOGIC PVDD PVSS DGND.
.subckt AD3541R_EQ CMD OUT AGND AVDD DVDD VLOGIC PVDD PVSS DGND
Bquant quant AGND V={DAC_SPAN/(2**DAC_BITS-1)*floor(min(max(V(CMD,AGND),0),DAC_SPAN)*(2**DAC_BITS-1)/DAC_SPAN+0.5)}
Rsettle quant settled 1k
Csettle settled AGND {DAC_TAU/1k}
Eout drive AGND settled AGND 1
Rout drive OUT 0.5
Ravdd AVDD AGND 1T
Rdvdd DVDD DGND 1T
Rvlogic VLOGIC DGND 1T
Rpvdd PVDD AGND 1T
Rpvss PVSS AGND 1T
.ends AD3541R_EQ
